          "text": "Pick off handoff from @docs/handoffs/handoff-2026-06-13-ux-polish-phase1.md and read @raw_log.md \n\nWe are at Phase 2 of Issue 11 https://github.com/psswid/triageflow-docs/issues/11\nCall for @OpenFrontendSpecialist . We have very humble frontend. We have already working triage feature, but from business perspective, our page don't remind anything attractive. One of purposes of this project is to present something that would be interesting from business client perspective or it recruitment perspective. \nIn current frontend app we are missing copywrites, basic set of pages like landing page, about us, etc, i'd need you to brainstorm business aspect of our app. Surely also cookies are missing, light and dark mode, translations (english and polish). \nlets start with /grill-with-docs to build list of what are we missing on our frontend including client and admin scopes. If there are any backend missing to newly planned frontend pages and features, add proper notes about it.",
