            "output": "<task id=\"ses_13d8f33fcffeRMgzphK5DMCek2\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nI now have all the data. Here is the comprehensive report.\n\n---\n\n# TriageFlow Frontend — Comprehensive Codebase Report\n\n## 1. Routes / Pages\n\n**File:** `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/routes.tsx`\n\nUses `createBrowserRouter` from React Router 7. All routes live under the root `/` path with `AppLayout` as the layout wrapper.\n\n| Path | Page Component | Access | Lazy Loaded? |\n|------|---------------|--------|:---:|\n| `/` | Redirects to `/triage` | -- | No |\n| `/verify-email` | `VerifyEmailPage` | Public | No |\n| `/login` | `LoginPage` | Public | **Yes** |\n| `/register` | `RegisterPage` | Public | **Yes** |\n| `/triage` | `TriagePage` | Auth (ProtectedRoute) | No |\n| `/triage/:id/result` | `TriageResultPage` | Auth | No |\n| `/submissions` | `MySubmissionsPage` | Auth | No |\n| `/admin` | `DashboardPage` | Admin (AdminRoute) | **Yes** |\n| `/admin/submissions/:id` | `SubmissionDetailPage` | Admin | **Yes** |\n| `/admin/users` | `UsersPage` | Admin | **Yes** |\n| `*` (catch-all) | `NotFoundPage` | -- | No |\n\n**Summary:** 10 actual routes (1 redirect + 1 404 catch-all). Only 8 unique page components. No landing page, no about page, no privacy/terms/contact pages, no cookie policy page — the SPA currently serves exclusively as an authenticated app tool.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Complete File / Directory Tree (`src/`)\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── api/\n│   ├── __tests__/\n│   │   └── types.test.ts\n│   ├── client.ts                          # Axios instance + JWT interceptor\n│   ├── endpoints.ts                       # All API endpoint paths\n│   └── types.ts                           # TypeScript interfaces (204 lines)\n├── components/\n│   ├── auth/\n│   │   └── AuthProvider.tsx               # Auth context + impersonation (159 lines)\n│   ├── layout/\n│   │   ├── AdminRoute.tsx                 # Admin-only guard\n│   │   ├── AppLayout.tsx                  # Root layout (header + main + impersonation banner)\n│   │   ├── Header.tsx                     # Top nav bar\n│   │   ├── ImpersonationBanner.tsx         # Yellow banner during impersonation\n│   │   └── ProtectedRoute.tsx             # Auth guard\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   ├── EmptyState.tsx                 # Empty state placeholder\n│   │   ├── ErrorBoundary.tsx              # Class-based error boundary\n│   │   ├── ErrorFallback.tsx              # Inline error display w/ details toggle\n│   │   ├── Loader.tsx                     # Centered spinner with message\n│   │   ├── NotFoundPage.tsx               # 404 page\n│   │   └── RouteErrorFallback.tsx         # Router-level error display\n│   └── ui/\n│       ├── Badge.tsx                      # Status/urgency badge\n│       ├── Button.tsx                     # Primary/secondary/danger button\n│       ├── Card.tsx                       # Bordered card container\n│       ├── Input.tsx                      # Form input with label + error\n│       ├── Skeleton.tsx                   # Loading skeletons (text/card/table/stats variants)\n│       ├── Spinner.tsx                    # SVG spinner (sm/md/lg)\n│       ├── Toast.tsx                      # Individual toast notification\n│       └── ToastProvider.tsx              # Toast context + manager\n├── e2e/\n│   └── basic.spec.ts                      # Playwright E2E tests\n├── features/\n│   ├── admin/\n│   │   ├── components/\n│   │   │   ├── FailedMessagesTable.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── ImpersonateButton.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── StatsGrid.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── SubmissionsTable.tsx\n│   │   │   └── UsersTable.tsx\n│   │   ├── hooks/\n│   │   │   ├── useAdminFailedMessages.ts\n│   │   │   ├── useAdminStats.ts\n│   │   │   ├── useAdminSubmission.ts\n│   │   │   ├── useAdminSubmissions.ts\n│   │   │   ├── useAdminUsers.ts\n│   │   │   └── useGenerateSyntheticCase.ts\n│   │   └── pages/\n│   │       ├── DashboardPage.tsx           # Tabbed admin dashboard\n│   │       ├── SubmissionDetailPage.tsx     # Single submission detail view\n│   │       └── UsersPage.tsx               # Stub — just a heading\n│   ├── auth/\n│   │   └── pages/\n│   │       ├── LoginPage.tsx\n│   │       ├── RegisterPage.tsx\n│   │       └── VerifyEmailPage.tsx\n│   ├── submissions/\n│   │   ├── components/\n│   │   │   └── SubmissionsList.tsx         # Table + empty/loading/error states\n│   │   ├── hooks/\n│   │   │   └── useMySubmissions.ts\n│   │   └── pages/\n│   │       └── MySubmissionsPage.tsx\n│   └── triage/\n│       ├── components/\n│       │   ├── AnswerInput.tsx\n│       │   ├── ConversationBubble.tsx\n│       │   ├── OutcomeCard.tsx\n│       │   ├── SymptomInput.tsx\n│       │   └── UrgencyBadge.tsx\n│       ├── hooks/\n│       │   ├── useTriageInterview.ts       # State machine driving the interview\n│       │   └── useTriagePolling.ts\n│       └── pages/\n│           ├── TriagePage.tsx              # Main interview page\n│           └── TriageResultPage.tsx        # Result display with conversation replay\n├── hooks/\n│   └── useAuth.ts                          # Auth context consumer hook\n├── lib/\n│   (empty)\n├── styles/\n│   └── index.css                           # Tailwind import + custom theme + dark mode\n├── test/\n│   ├── setup.ts                            # Vitest setup (jest-dom matchers)\n│   ├── admin/\n│   │   ├── DashboardPage.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── FailedMessagesTable.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── ImpersonateButton.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── StatsGrid.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── SubmissionDetailPage.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── SubmissionsTable.test.tsx\n│   │   └── UsersTable.test.tsx\n│   ├── shared/\n│   │   └── ErrorFallback.test.tsx\n│   ├── triage/\n│   │   ├── ConversationBubble.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── OutcomeCard.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── TriagePage.test.tsx\n│   │   ├── TriageResultPage.test.tsx\n│   │   └── useTriageInterview.test.ts\n│   └── ui/\n│       ├── Skeleton.test.tsx\n│       ├── Toast.test.tsx\n│       └── ToastProvider.test.tsx\n├── App.tsx                                 # Root: AuthProvider + RouterProvider\n├── main.tsx                                # Entry: QueryClient + Toast + StrictMode\n├── routes.tsx                              # Route definitions (69 lines)\n└── vite-env.d.ts                           # Vite type declarations\n```\n\n**Component count:** 37 source `.tsx`/`.ts` files in `src/` (excluding test files and Vite types).\n\n---\n\n## 3. `package.json` Dependencies\n\n**File:** `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/package.json`\n\n### Runtime Dependencies\n| Package | Version | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `@tanstack/react-query` | ^5.100.14 | Server state, caching, polling |\n| `axios` | ^1.16.1 | HTTP client |\n| `clsx` | ^2.1.1 | Conditional class name helper |\n| `react` | ^19.2.6 | UI framework |\n| `react-dom` | ^19.2.6 | React DOM renderer |\n| `react-router-dom` | ^7.16.0 | Client-side routing |\n\n### Dev Dependencies\n| Package | Version | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `@tailwindcss/vite` | ^4.3.0 | Tailwind CSS 4 Vite plugin |\n| `tailwindcss` | ^4.3.0 | Utility-first CSS framework |\n| `@vitejs/plugin-react` | ^6.0.1 | Vite React plugin |\n| `vite` | ^8.0.12 | Build tool + dev server |\n| `typescript` | ~6.0.2 | Type checking |\n| `vitest` | ^4.1.7 | Unit test runner |\n| `@testing-library/react` | ^16.3.2 | Component testing |\n| `@testing-library/jest-dom` | ^6.9.1 | DOM matchers |\n| `jsdom` | ^29.1.1 | Browser environment for tests |\n| `@playwright/test` | ^1.60.0 | E2E browser tests |\n| `eslint` | ^10.3.0 | Linting |\n| `typescript-eslint` | ^8.59.2 | TypeScript ESLint |\n\n### What is NOT in package.json (relevant for a \"business presentation\" website):\n- **No i18n library**: No `react-i18next`, `i18next`, `react-intl`, or any localization package\n- **No cookie consent library**: No `react-cookie-consent`, `cookieconsent`, `js-cookie`, etc.\n- **No analytics**: No `@vercel/analytics`, `ga-4-react`, etc.\n- **No SEO/meta**: No `react-helmet-async` or similar\n- **No form library**: Login/Register use plain React state (no `react-hook-form`, `zod`)\n- **No animation library**: No `framer-motion`, `react-spring`, etc.\n- **No component library**: Everything is custom-built with Tailwind (no `shadcn/ui`, `radix`, `headless-ui`)\n\n---\n\n## 4. Dark Mode — Current State\n\n**File:** `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/styles/index.css`\n\nDark mode is **CSS-only** via Tailwind's `@variant dark` directive:\n\n```css\n@variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));\n\nhtml {\n  @apply bg-white text-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100;\n}\n```\n\n**How it works:**\n- Every component uses `dark:` variants in Tailwind classes (e.g., `dark:bg-gray-900`, `dark:text-gray-100`)\n- All UI components are fully dark-mode-aware\n- Uses the **class-based strategy** — dark mode activates when the `.dark` class is added to an ancestor element\n\n**What's missing:**\n- **No dark mode toggle component** — there is no button or switch anywhere to toggle dark mode\n- **No `useDarkMode` hook** — no JS-based preference management\n- **No `localStorage` persistence** — no saved theme preference across sessions\n- **No system preference detection** — no `prefers-color-scheme` media query usage\n- **No theme provider context**\n\nThe dark mode infrastructure is in place (CSS classes), but there is zero user-facing toggle or initialization logic.\n\n---\n\n## 5. i18n / Translations / Localization\n\n**Status: Completely absent.**\n\n- No i18n libraries in `package.json`\n- No locale files, translation JSON, or language selection UI\n- No `useTranslation` hook or equivalent\n- All UI text is hardcoded English strings in JSX\n- No `lang` attribute handling beyond the static `<html lang=\"en\">` in `index.html`\n- No RTL support infrastructure\n\n---\n\n## 6. Cookie Consent\n\n**Status: Completely absent.**\n\n- No cookie consent banner or popup\n- No cookie preference management\n- No `react-cookie-consent` or equivalent\n- The only cookies in the lock files are transitive dependencies from `msw` and `jsdom` — not used by the app itself\n- The app uses `localStorage` for the JWT token and `sessionStorage` for impersonation state, but no cookie-based storage\n\n---\n\n## 7. Landing Page / Public-Facing Pages\n\n**Status: No public-facing marketing/info pages exist.**\n\nThe SPA has **zero** of these pages:\n- **No landing page** (`/` redirects to `/triage`, which requires auth)\n- **No about page** (`/about`)\n- **No privacy policy page** (`/privacy`)\n- **No terms of service page** (`/terms`)\n- **No contact page** (`/contact`)\n- **No pricing page** (`/pricing`)\n- **No FAQ page** (`/faq`)\n- **No cookie policy page** (`/cookies`)\n\nThe only public (unauthenticated) routes are `/login`, `/register`, and `/verify-email`. Everything else requires authentication.\n\nThe page title in `index.html` is still the Vite boilerplate: `<title>frontend</title>`.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Footer\n\n**Status: No footer component exists.**\n\n`AppLayout.tsx` renders only:\n1. `<Header />`\n2. `<ImpersonationBanner />`\n3. `<main><Outlet /></main>`\n\nThere is no footer with copyright, links, or any other content.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Design System — Tailwind Config & Theme Tokens\n\n**File:** `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/styles/index.css`\n\n### Custom Theme Tokens (via Tailwind CSS 4 `@theme` directive):\n\n```css\n@theme {\n  --color-primary-50: #eff6ff;       /* Light blue tint */\n  --color-primary-500: #3b82f6;      /* Blue-500 (Tailwind default) */\n  --color-primary-900: #1e3a5f;      /* Dark navy blue */\n  --color-urgency-low: #22c55e;      /* Green */\n  --color-urgency-medium: #eab308;   /* Yellow */\n  --color-urgency-high: #f97316;     /* Orange */\n  --color-urgency-emergency: #ef4444; /* Red */\n}\n```\n\n### Design Tokens Inventory:\n\n| Token Type | Defined? | Notes |\n|-----------|----------|-------|\n| Color palette | Minimal | Only primary (3 shades) + urgency (4 levels). No secondary, accent, neutral, success, warning, error tokens |\n| Typography (font family) | No | Using Tailwind defaults (Inter/system-ui stack) |\n| Font sizes | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n| Font weights | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n| Spacing scale | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n| Border radius | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n| Shadows | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n| Breakpoints | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n| Animation/transition | No | Using Tailwind defaults |\n\n### Component Design Patterns:\n\nAll components are **custom-built with Tailwind CSS** — no third-party component library (no shadcn/ui, Radix, Headless UI). Consistent patterns observed:\n\n1. **Button**: 3 variants (`primary` blue, `secondary` gray, `danger` red), 3 sizes (`sm/md/lg`), `isLoading` state with inline spinner\n2. **Card**: Rounded-xl, bordered, white background, subtle shadow, 24px padding\n3. **Input**: Label + border + focus ring (blue-500), error state (red border), dark mode support\n4. **Badge**: Rounded-full pill with color-coded backgrounds (status + urgency mappings)\n5. **Toast**: Fixed bottom-right, auto-dismiss after 5s, 3 variants (error/warning/info), aria attributes\n6. **Skeleton**: 4 variants (text/card/table-row/stats-grid), pulse animation\n7. **Spinner**: SVG-based, 3 sizes, `aria-hidden`\n8. **All components**: Full dark mode coverage, focus-visible rings, disabled states, aria attributes where appropriate\n\n### Typography:\n- Body: Tailwind defaults (text-sm/text-base)\n- Headings: text-lg through text-2xl, bold\n- Font family: Not customized — inherits Tailwind's default Inter/system-ui stack\n- The `index.html` `<title>` is still `frontend`\n\n---\n\n## 10. Summary: What's Missing for a \"Business Presentation\" Website\n\n### Critical Gaps (no code exists at all):\n| Feature | Status |\n|---------|--------|\n| Landing page (public home) | **Missing** |\n| About page | **Missing** |\n| Privacy policy page | **Missing** |\n| Terms of service page | **Missing** |\n| Contact page | **Missing** |\n| Cookie consent banner | **Missing** |\n| Cookie policy page | **Missing** |\n| Dark mode toggle | **Missing** (CSS infrastructure exists, no JS control) |\n| i18n / translations | **Missing** |\n| Footer component | **Missing** |\n| SEO meta tags | **Missing** (static `<title>frontend</title>`) |\n| Favicon | Present (`/favicon.svg` and `/icons.svg` exist in `public/`) |\n| Accessibility beyond aria | Partial — components have aria attributes but no axe-core or automated testing |\n\n### Existing But Needing Polish:\n| Feature | Status |\n|---------|--------|\n| Dark mode CSS | Ready — all components have `dark:` variants |\n| Theme tokens | Thin — only primary shades + urgency colors |\n| Error handling | Good — ErrorBoundary, ErrorFallback, RouteErrorFallback all exist |\n| Loading states | Good — Skeleton (4 variants), Loader, Spinner all exist |\n| Empty states | Good — EmptyState component exists |\n| Not found (404) | Good — NotFoundPage exists |\n| Auth flow | Fully implemented (Login, Register, Verify Email, JWT, impersonation) |\n| Responsive layout | Good — uses Tailwind responsive utilities throughout |\n| Test coverage | Good — 81 Vitest tests + Playwright E2E |\n\n---\n\n### Key File Paths (Absolute):\n- Routes: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/routes.tsx`\n- App entry: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/App.tsx`\n- Main entry: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/main.tsx`\n- CSS/Theme: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/styles/index.css`\n- Package: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/package.json`\n- API types: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/api/types.ts`\n- API endpoints: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/api/endpoints.ts`\n- Auth provider: `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend/src/components/auth/AuthProvider.tsx`\n- App layout: `/home/