tures, add proper notes about it.\"\n\nThe grill session is now complete. I should present the consolidated list, update CONTEXT.md with any new terms if needed, and then we move to the proposal stage. But the user also wants me to call OpenFrontendSpecialist.\n\nLet me present the final consolidated inventory and ask if they're ready to proceed. Then I'll propose next steps including calling OpenFrontendSpecialist.",
