blic pages — marketing nav (no auth), footer |\n| 9 | **Footer** | Copyright, dark mode toggle, language switcher, legal links |\n| 10 | **Dark mode toggle** | `useDarkMode` hook, system pref + localStorage, sun/moon icon |\n| 11 | **Cookie consent banner** | Bare-minimum notice, localStorage dismissed flag |\n| 12 | **i18n (EN + PL)** | `react-i18next`, browser detection, JSON locale files, all pages translated |\n| 13 | **SEO meta** | `<Helmet>` per-page titles/descriptions, OG tags |\n| 14 | **Design tokens** | Add teal accent, slate grays, larger typography scale |\n\n### Existing Pages (need i18n + polish)\n\n| # | Page | Scope |\n|---|---|---|\n| 15 | LoginPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 16 | RegisterPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 17 | VerifyEmailPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 18 | TriagePage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 19 | TriageResultPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 20 | MySubmissionsPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 21 | DashboardPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 22 | SubmissionDetailPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 23 | UsersPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n| 24 | NotFoundPage | Translate all strings, PL locale |\n\n### Backend Changes Needed\n\n| # | Change | Details |\n|---|---|---|\n| 25 | Localized email templates | Verification email in PL when user's detected locale is Polish |\n| 26 | (Optional) `Accept-Language` header in CORS | Ensure the header passes through to backend |\n\n---\n\nNow, before I propose the full execution approach — I want to update `CONTEXT.md` with any new terms we've introduced. Let me check: we haven't changed the domain language really — these are frontend presentation terms (layouts, pages), not domain concepts. So `CONTEXT.md` stays as-is.\n\n**Ready to propose the execution approach. Shall I call OpenFrontendSpecialist to design the visual treatment and component architecture, or do you want me to present the implementation proposal first?**",
