          "text": "## Phase 2 Plan Complete\n\nI've created the comprehensive implementation plan at:\n\n**📄 `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-13-business-website-layer.md`**\n\n### Summary\n\n**17 tasks, 8 execution batches**, ~50 files created/modified across frontend + 1 backend change.\n\n| Batch | Tasks | What |\n|-------|-------|------|\n| **Batch 1** | 1, 2, 3 | Dependencies + design tokens + i18n EN/PL locale files |\n| **Batch 2** | 4, 5 | Dark mode toggle + CookieBanner + LanguageSwitcher |\n| **Batch 3** | 6 | MarketingLayout (MarketingHeader + Footer) |\n| **Batch 4** | 7, 8, 9, 10 | All 7 public pages + providers wiring |\n| **Batch 5** | 11 | Route restructuring (MarketingLayout vs AppLayout) |\n| **Batch 6** | 12, 13, 14, 17 | i18n migration of all existing pages + backend PL email |\n| **Batch 7** | 15 | Footer added to AppLayout |\n| **Batch 8** | 16 | Full integration verification |\n\n### Key architectural decisions baked into the plan:\n- **Two layouts**: `MarketingLayout` (public pages with own header/footer) + `AppLayout` (authenticated, existing)\n- **i18n namespaces**: `common`, `landing`, `about`, `howItWorks`, `legal`, `auth`, `triage`, `admin`\n- **Dark mode**: `useDarkMode` hook with system preference + localStorage override, applied via `.dark` class on `<html>` (Tailwind CSS 4 strategy already in place)\n- **Backend**: Only change is localized PL email subject/body in `RegistrationController` via `Accept-Language` header\n\n### Backend notes:\n- No new backend endpoints needed (public pages are static HTML/CSS via React, no API)\n- No contact form backend (links to external piotrswiderski.dev)\n- One small change: Polish email template for registration verification\n\n---\n\n**Approval needed before proceeding to implementation.** Would you like me to delegate this to TaskManager for breakdown into parallel subtasks, or execute directly with OpenFrontendSpecialist?",
