          "text": "I now have a rich set of results. Let me synthesize them before calling OpenFrontendSpecialist:\n\n**Design System Summary from UI/UX Pro Max:**\n\n**Pattern:** Product Demo + Features (landing)\n**Style:** Glassmorphism with backdrop blur, layered effects\n**Colors:** \n- Design system search: Monochrome + blue accent (Primary #18181B, CTA #2563EB, BG #FAFAFA)\n- Healthcare search: Medical teal (#0891B2) + health green (#22C55E), cyan secondary (#22D3EE)\n- Our existing: Primary blue-600 (#2563eb), Accent teal-500 (#14b8a6)\n\nRECOMMENDATION: Merge — keep our existing blue primary (#2563EB) as CTA color, add teal accent from healthcare palette (#0891B2), use the healthcare BG (#F0FDFA tint) for light backgrounds. The monochrome primary (#18181B) works for text, not UI chrome.\n\n**Typography:** Poppins (headings) + Open Sans (body) — excellent modern clean pairing\n- CSS import: `@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');`\n\n**Effects:** Backdrop blur (10-20px), subtle borders, light reflection\n\n**UX Guidelines:**\n- Skeleton screens for loading (already have this!)\n- No continuous animations on decorative elements\n- Font display: swap\n- Lazy load below-fold content\n\n**Stack (html-tailwind):**\n- Card hover: `hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow`\n- Responsive padding: `px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`\n- Cards: `rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6`\n- Consistent card spacing: `space-y-4`\n- Visibility: `hidden md:block`\n\nNow let me combine all of this and delegate to OpenFrontendSpecialist. The prompt should include:\n1. The design system findings\n2. Current codebase state (what we already have)\n3. The plan details for the 7 new pages\n4. Specific design enhancement requests for each page\n5. The color palette merge recommendation\n6. Typography recommendation",
