iew**: New component with browser chrome mockup + screenshot placeholder\n- **AboutPage**: Red disclaimer → amber (`border-amber-200 bg-amber-50`, `AlertTriangle` icon), developer identity (initials circle + GitHub link), \"Tech Decisions\" card grid, section headings with `border-l-4 border-primary-500 pl-4`\n- **HowItWorksPage**: Added vertical timeline line (`absolute left-6 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-300 via-accent-300`), CTA changed to `bg-accent-500`\n- **ContactPage**: Expanded to frosted card with initials circle + 2×2 social grid (Portfolio/teal, GitHub/LinkedIn/Email bordered)\n\n### Task 9 (Legal Pages)\n- **All three pages** (Privacy, Terms, Cookies): Added sticky ToC sidebar (desktop only, `hidden lg:block w-56`), sections wrapped in bordered cards (`rounded-xl border p-6`), Terms/Cookies use Lucide icons per section, max-width widened from `max-w-3xl` to `max-w-5xl` for sidebar layout"
