            "output": "<path>/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-13-business-website-layer.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Business Website Layer + i18n + Dark Mode Implementation Plan\n2: \n3: > **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.\n4: \n5: **Goal:** Transform the frontend from a bare authenticated SPA into a dual-purpose application: public-facing marketing website (landing, about, how-it-works, legal pages) + authenticated triage tool — with i18n (EN + PL), dark mode toggle, cookie consent, and a unified medical triage design system.\n6: \n7: **Architecture:** Two layout wrappers — `MarketingLayout` for public unauthenticated pages (with own header, footer, dark mode toggle, language switcher) and the existing `AppLayout` for authenticated pages. Both share a single `I18nProvider` (react-i18next), `ThemeProvider` (dark mode via system preference + localStorage override), and unified Tailwind design tokens. All pages translated via JSON locale files.\n8: \n9: **Tech Stack:** react-i18next, i18next-browser-languagedetector, react-helmet-async, lucide-react (icon system), Tailwind CSS 4, Poppins (Google Fonts headings), React Router 7, TanStack Query (existing), clsx (existing)\n10: \n11: ---\n12: \n13: ## File Structure Map\n14: \n15: ```\n16: src/\n17: ├── i18n/\n18: │   ├── index.ts                          # i18next initialization + browser detection\n19: │   └── locales/\n20: │       ├── en/\n21: │       │   ├── common.json               # Shared: buttons, nav, footer, errors\n22: │       │   ├── landing.json              # Landing page copy\n23: │       │   ├── about.json                # About page copy\n24: │       │   ├── howItWorks.json           # How It Works page copy\n25: │       │   ├── legal.json                # Privacy, Terms, Cookies pages\n26: │       │   ├── auth.json                 # Login, Register, Verify Email\n27: │       │   ├── triage.json               # Triage interview + result pages\n28: │       │   └── admin.json                # Dashboard, submissions, users\n29: │       └── pl/\n30: │           ├── common.json\n31: │           ├── landing.json\n32: │           ├── about.json\n33: │           ├── howItWorks.json\n34: │           ├── legal.json\n35: │           ├── auth.json\n36: │           ├── triage.json\n37: │           └── admin.json\n38: ├── hooks/\n39: │   ├── useAuth.ts                        # (existing)\n40: │   └── useDarkMode.ts                    # NEW: system pref + localStorage + toggle\n41: ├── components/\n42: │   ├── auth/\n43: │   │   └── AuthProvider.tsx              # (existing — add I18nProvider integration)\n44: │   ├── layout/\n45: │   │   ├── AdminRoute.tsx                # (existing)\n46: │   │   ├── AppLayout.tsx                 # (existing — add Footer)\n47: │   │   ├── Header.tsx                    # (existing — add i18n)\n48: │   │   ├── ImpersonationBanner.tsx       # (existing — add i18n)\n49: │   │   ├── ProtectedRoute.tsx            # (existing)\n50: │   │   ├── MarketingLayout.tsx           # NEW: public page wrapper\n51: │   │   ├── MarketingHeader.tsx           # NEW: public nav (Home, About, How It Works, Login, dark toggle, lang switcher)\n52: │   │   └── Footer.tsx                    # NEW: copyright, legal links, dark toggle, lang switcher\n53: │   ├── shared/\n54: │   │   ├── CookieBanner.tsx              # NEW: minimal consent notice\n55: │   │   ├── DarkModeToggle.tsx            # NEW: sun/moon icon button\n56: │   │   ├── LanguageSwitcher.tsx          # NEW: EN/PL toggle\n57: │   │   ├── EmptyState.tsx                # (existing — add i18n)\n58: │   │   ├── ErrorBoundary.tsx             # (existing)\n59: │   │   ├── ErrorFallback.tsx             # (existing — add i18n)\n60: │   │   ├── Loader.tsx                    # (exist