u\": \"Otwórz menu\", \"closeMenu\": \"Zamknij menu\" }\n```\n\nThe `header` key should be added alongside existing top-level keys like `nav`, `footer`, etc.\n\n---\n\n### Verification:\nAfter all fixes, run:\n- `cd /home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend && npx tsc --noEmit` — must be clean\n- `cd /home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend && npx vitest run` — all 136 tests must pass\n- `cd /home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/frontend && npx eslint src/ 2>&1 | tail -3` — must show exit 0 (clean)\n\nReturn a report of every file changed and verification results.",
