          "text": "## Goal\n- Expand TriageFlow from a bare authenticated SPA into a full business-presentation frontend with public marketing pages, i18n, dark mode, cookie consent, and design polish.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Sarcastic, self-aware \"4th wall breaking\" demo tone, not fake medical credibility\n- EN + PL translations with `react-i18next`, browser language detection\n- Dark mode: system preference + localStorage toggle, sun/moon button\n- Cookie consent: minimal one-click dismiss (no tracking, no category toggles)\n- Design: Lucide icons (no emojis), Poppins headings + Inter body, glassmorphism hero\n- Accessibility: build accessible-by-default but formal audit deferred to follow-up\n\n## Progress\n\n### Done\n- Grill session: 10 decisions resolved (scope, tone, page inventory, i18n stack, layouts, cookies, backend needs)\n- Design review: 15 changes from OpenFrontendSpecialist + ui-ux-pro-max (Lucide icons, mobile hamburger, glassmorphism, timeline, ToC, social grid, amber disclaimer, Poppins)\n- Implementation plan: `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-13-business-website-layer.md` — 17 tasks, 8 batches\n- Tasks 1-17 executed: deps, design tokens, 16 locale files (EN+PL), dark mode hook + toggle, cookie banner, language switcher, MarketingLayout+Footer, LandingPage, AboutPage, HowItWorksPage, ContactPage, PrivacyPage, TermsPage, CookiesPage, TableOfContents, provider wiring, route restructuring, i18n migration (26 source files), backend localized email\n- Code review: 11 issues resolved (C1 ThemeInit render fix, C2 dangerouslySetInnerHTML, I1 route layout for unauth pages, I2/I7 i18n holes, I4/I5/I8/I9 content fixes, I6 email signature, I10 +10 new tests)\n- Final verification: TSC clean, ESLint clean, 146/146 tests (24 files), build passes, PHP syntax clean\n- ADR-0008: `docs/adr/0008-dual-purpose-frontend-architecture.md`\n- Handoff: `docs/handoffs/handoff-2026-06-14-business-website-layer.md`\n- Raw log: `2026-06-14 — Business Website Layer [COMPLETE]` entry appended\n- All 3 repos committed and pushed to `origin/master`: frontend `f057aac`, backend `5374a6f`, docs `d48c2fd`\n\n### In Progress\n- (none)\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- Issue #11 expanded: Phase 2 redefined from accessibility audit to full business polish (landing pages, i18n, dark mode, cookies)\n- Dual-layout architecture: MarketingLayout (public pages) + AppLayout (authenticated) — not separate apps\n- i18n: `react-i18next` + `i18next-browser-languagedetector`, 16 JSON files (8 EN + 8 PL), namespace-organized (common, landing, about, howItWorks, legal, auth, triage, admin)\n- Backend: email translation via `Accept-Language` header only — no contact form endpoint needed\n- Routes: login/register/verify-email in standalone route group (no AppLayout), authenticated routes behind `<ProtectedRoute><AppLayout />`, public routes under `<MarketingLayout>`\n- Dark mode init moved to `main.tsx` before `createRoot()` (bootstrap pattern) — not a React component\n\n## Next Steps\n- Start app locally: `cd frontend && npm run dev` + `cd backend && symfony serve -d`\n- Accessibility audit (deferred from Issue #11 Phase 2) — manual WCAG checklist per handoff\n- Replace demo placeholder screenshot in LandingPage with real screenshot\n\n## Critical Context\n- Local dev URLs: frontend at `localhost:5173`, backend at `localhost:8000`\n- OpenRouter free tier (gemma-4-31b-it:free) hits 429 rate limits in demo — expected behavior\n- ThemeInit runs in `main.tsx` before React hydrates (not in App.tsx) — prevents flash-of-wrong-theme\n- All 3 repos are separate git repos on `master` — no submodules\n- Frontend branch `master` ahead of `origin/master` by 0 (all pushed)\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-13-business-website-layer.md`: Full implementation plan (17 tasks)\n- `frontend/src/routes.tsx`: Dual-layout routing (MarketingLayout + AppLayout + standalone unauth)\n- `frontend/src/i18n/index.ts`: i18n initialization with LanguageDetector, EN + PL resources\n- `frontend/src/i18n/locales/en/*.json`, `frontend/src/i18n/locales/pl/*.json`: 16 locale files\n- `frontend/src/hooks/useDarkMode.ts`: Dark mode hook (system pref + localStorage + toggle)\n- `frontend/src/components/layout/MarketingLayout.tsx`: Public layout with MarketingHeader + Footer\n- `frontend/src/components/layout/MarketingHeader.tsx`: Sticky nav with mobile hamburger drawer, i18n, dark mode toggle\n- `frontend/src/components/layout/Footer.tsx`: 3-column footer (brand, legal links, tools)\n- `frontend/src/components/shared/CookieBanner.tsx`: Minimal one-click consent banner\n- `frontend/src/components/shared/LanguageSwitcher.tsx`: EN/PL segmented control\n- `frontend/src/components/shared/DarkModeToggle.tsx`: Sun/moon toggle button\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/LandingPage.tsx`: Glassmorphism hero, 4 feature cards (Lucide), demo preview, tech stack\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/AboutPage.tsx`: Developer identity, Tech Decisions grid, amber disclaimer\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/HowItWorksPage.tsx`: 4-step vertical timeline with gradient number circles\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/ContactPage.tsx`: Frosted card with 2×2 social grid\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/PrivacyPage.tsx`: Sticky ToC sidebar, 6 card-wrapped sections\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/TermsPage.tsx`: FlaskConical/Stethoscope/ShieldOff/Database icons per section\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/pages/CookiesPage.tsx`: HardDrive/Layers/EyeOff icons per section\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/components/TableOfContents.tsx`: Sticky sidebar with IntersectionObserver active-state tracking\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/components/StepCard.tsx`: Timeline step with gradient number circle\n- `frontend/src/features/marketing/components/DemoPreview.tsx`: Browser chrome mockup\n- `backend/src/User/Infrastructure/Controller/RegistrationController.php`: Localized PL email via Accept-Language\n- `docs/adr/0008-dual-purpose-frontend-architecture.md`: Dual-purpose frontend architecture ADR\n- `docs/handoffs/handoff-2026-06-14-business-website-layer.md`: Full session handoff",
