ed.\n\n### Issue 4 — Missing `<main>` landmark\n**Files**: `LoginPage.tsx`, `RegisterPage.tsx`, `VerifyEmailPage.tsx` — Changed outer `<div>` → `<main>` (opening + closing tags)\n\n### Issue 5 — Links distinguishable without color\n**Files**: `LoginPage.tsx` L70, `RegisterPage.tsx` L68, `VerifyEmailPage.tsx` L64,76,97 — Added `underline` to base class, `hover:no-underline` for polish\n\n### Issue 6 — Heading hierarchy\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `StatsGrid.tsx` L56,71 | `<h3>` → `<h2>` (skip from h1 to h3 eliminated) |\n| `StepCard.tsx` L13 | `<h3>` → `<h2>` (step titles now proper h2 level) |\n| `HowItWorksPage.test.tsx` L20 | Updated test: `level: 3` → `level: 2` |\n</task_result>\n</task>",
