elegated fixes to OpenFrontendSpecialist\nAll 6 fixed across 15 files. Lint clean, 146/146 tests pass.\n\n### Verified Lighthouse scores\nUser confirmed: minimum score now **91/100** (was 83).\n\n### Committed and pushed\n`679376f` on frontend repo `master`. Message: `fix(a11y): resolve 6 Lighthouse accessibility issues across 15 pages`"
